(7294760, 1137012, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit soft or maybe over sharpened? I''m guessing it''s a quick found-objects shot but the scattered water drops on the one leaf look discordant to me somehow.</td>', 'Looks a bit soft or maybe over sharpened? I''m guessing it''s a quick found-objects shot but the scattered water drops on the one leaf look discordant to me somehow.', '2014-12-21 22:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
