(7294867, 1137034, 163081, '<td valign="top">So surprised to ribbon with this shot. I bought about 20 different flowers at the flower market (it''s very cheap here in Taiwan) and took about 100 shots for this challenge. I wanted something colorful. Then I had this box of white Iceberg roses for another project (wedding invitation card) and didn''t like the sober white color. I only wanted to keep the curves with a very white tone. It turned out that I went darker and kept more detail.  This macro shot is barely processed. Basic editing. I didn''t copy ideas from others. <br/>I look at the shots the day after and the ones that jump out I preselect.  Then selecting  the best one. I''ll send my outtakes later.<br/>Still thanks to all the voters for the nice comments and high votes.<br/>To Neat: I do not take pictures for what the voters like, but what I like and what I enter I like that moment (and my mood). <br/></td>', 'So surprised to ribbon with this shot. I bought about 20 different flowers at the flower market (it''s very cheap here in Taiwan) and took about 100 shots for this challenge. I wanted something colorful. Then I had this box of white Iceberg roses for another project (wedding invitation card) and didn''t like the sober white color. I only wanted to keep the curves with a very white tone. It turned out that I went darker and kept more detail.  This macro shot is barely processed. Basic editing. I didn''t copy ideas from others. I look at the shots the day after and the ones that jump out I preselect.  Then selecting  the best one. I''ll send my outtakes later.Still thanks to all the voters for the nice comments and high votes.To Neat: I do not take pictures for what the voters like, but what I like and what I enter I like that moment (and my mood). ', '2014-12-22 06:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
